{"id":"55d3981c6d723079","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/863_仿射逻辑_Affine_Logic.md","title":"863 仿射逻辑 Affine Logic","display":"863_仿射逻辑_Affine_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"863-仿射逻辑-Affine-Logic\">863 仿射逻辑 Affine Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为命题原子集合，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}\">\\(\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}\\)</span>，文字对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial\">\\(\\partial\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p)=p^\\perp\">\\(\\partial(p)=p^\\perp\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^\\perp)=p\">\\(\\partial(p^\\perp)=p\\)</span>。仿射逻辑采用下列公式构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top},\n\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{plus},\\operatorname{with}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top},\n\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{plus},\\operatorname{with}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{plus},\\operatorname{with}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{plus},\\operatorname{with}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目没有指数构造子；仿射性由任意公式弱化规则给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式生成\">2. 公式生成</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\operatorname{with}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-对偶\">3. 对偶</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^\\perp:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\((-)^\\perp:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atm}(\\partial(a)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atm}(\\partial(a)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}^\\perp=\\operatorname{top},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top}^\\perp=\\operatorname{zero},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{zero}^\\perp=\\operatorname{top},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top}^\\perp=\\operatorname{zero},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{ten}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{ten}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{with}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{with}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{plus}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{with}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{plus}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由原子与替换\">4. 自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p)=p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^\\perp)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^\\perp)=p\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bot})=\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{top})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bot})=\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{top})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ten}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ten}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{plus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{with}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{with}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p)=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p)=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^\\perp)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^\\perp)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{top},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{zero}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{zero},\\quad\n\\operatorname{top}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{top},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ten}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ten}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{plus}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{plus}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{with}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{with}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{with}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{with}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Aff}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Aff}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-上下文与序列\">5. 上下文与序列</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}=\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathbb N:\\{A:\\Gamma(A)\\ne0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctx}=\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathbb N:\\{A:\\Gamma(A)\\ne0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma+\\Delta)(A)=\\Gamma(A)+\\Delta(A)\">\\((\\Gamma+\\Delta)(A)=\\Gamma(A)+\\Delta(A)\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 处重数增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的上下文。序列集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下文相等取函数外延相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\,\\Gamma(A)=\\Delta(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma=_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\\Delta\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\,\\Gamma(A)=\\Delta(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-公理族\">6. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\vdash\\varnothing,A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\vdash\\varnothing,A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathbf1}=\\{\\vdash\\varnothing,\\operatorname{one}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathbf1}=\\{\\vdash\\varnothing,\\operatorname{one}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{top}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathbf1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathbf1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\top}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-规则关系\">7. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1})\">\\(\\Pi=(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1})\\)</span>，约定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=(\\Pi,Q),\n\\qquad\n(();Q):=((),Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=(\\Pi,Q),\n\\qquad\n(();Q):=((),Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下列分号只表示这一有序对编码。</p>\n<p>逻辑规则族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B);\\vdash\\Gamma+\\Delta,\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B);\\vdash\\Gamma+\\Delta,\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,0}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,0}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,1}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,1}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{plus}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Gamma,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{with}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Gamma,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{with}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>仿射结构规则族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp);\\vdash\\Gamma+\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp);\\vdash\\Gamma+\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,0}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,0}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\oplus,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\with}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>仿射逻辑的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}}\\)</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 非空，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-证明树\">8. 证明树</h1>\n<p>定义有限有根有序树为四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne r\">\\(u\\ne r\\)</span> 有唯一父节点，不存在有向环，且每个节点沿有限条父边到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>。每个节点另有全部直接子节点的无重复有序枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u):n_u\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u):n_u\\to T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>仿射证明树是五元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>叶节点标号属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>内节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点标号元组与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\">\\(\\ell(u)\\)</span> 组成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\)</span> 的元素。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\text{ 是仿射证明树且 }\\ell(r)=\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\text{ 是仿射证明树且 }\\ell(r)=\\vdash\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-可导性\">9. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}}\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(Q)=\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\text{ 是仿射证明树且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(Q)=\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\text{ 是仿射证明树且 }\\ell(r)=Q\\},\n\\quad Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Frm},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Ctx},=_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Aff}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Frm},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Ctx},=_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{weak}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{contr}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Aff}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只规定仿射句法证明关系；不含指数、收缩、外部语义资源模型或割消去定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"863-仿射逻辑-Affine-Logic","text":"863 仿射逻辑 Affine Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式生成","text":"2. 公式生成","level":1},{"id":"3.-对偶","text":"3. 对偶","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由原子与替换","text":"4. 自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-上下文与序列","text":"5. 上下文与序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-公理族","text":"6. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"7.-规则关系","text":"7. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-证明树","text":"8. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"9.-可导性","text":"9. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial(p)=p^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial(p^\\perp)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top},\n\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par},\\operatorname{plus},\\operatorname{with}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{top}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}